      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "ヤシン提督という方が、女神ユ・ファスが肌身離さず\n着けていたとされる指輪を持っているそうです。\nそれを、どうしても譲っていただきたいのです。\n交渉の場に、一緒に来ていただけませんか？",
        "official_en": "It's rumored that Admiral Jarcham has a ring that\nthe goddess Yu Phas kept with her at all times.\nI'd really like to have it. Would you please come to\nthe negotiations with me?",
        "real_en": "It's rumored that Admiral Yashin has a ring that\nthe goddess Yu Phas kept with her at all times.\nI'd really like to have it. Would you please come to\nthe negotiations with me?"
      },
