      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "今回はとてもお世話になりました！\nお陰で無事に指輪を取り戻せました……\n本当にありがとうございます。\nもし皆さんに何かあれば、私が力になりますね。",
        "official_en": "Thank you for your help! I was finally able to\nrecover the ring. Really, I can't thank you enough.\nIf anything happens to all of you, count on me to\ndo what I can to help you in return.",
